      "description": "The meme relies on the cultural stereotype that leaders or important figures can be trivialized by comparing them to everyday, mundane items like crackers. This is a form of devaluation that uses humor to mock the seriousness of political leadership, which requires understanding of how such comparisons are culturally perceived.",
