      "label": "User projected onto the cracker_presidents_metaphor scene",
      "description": "The user is projected onto the visual metaphor of U.S. presidents represented by crackers, as the meme invites the viewer to interpret the image as a satirical commentary on presidential history. The user is expected to understand the absurd juxtaposition and participate in the meme's humor by mentally mapping the crackers to presidents, thus engaging with the scene as the primary locus of meaning.",
